      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "The winning run of MOSTERT NZ (9) came to an end last time but he was far from disgraced when fourth from the back row. Draws there again so may need some luck but he had looked very good in winning his previous four outings here so must be given another chance. FOR REAL LIFE (3) draws much better than he did last start. That effort followed a nice third when kicking off his campaign at this circuit and distance two runs ago. Has the benefit of a good draw and his fitness will be building. AIR EXPRESS (6) must be considered having produced two solid efforts from back row draws since winning here the last time he started on the front line. BIRKIRKARA (4) hasn't been too bad at his last couple and is capable of featuring in a race like this.",
